# Minar Insights database (Supabase). Copy to .env.local and fill in from Project Settings > API.
# Leave empty to run the facilitator desk in device-only mode (no sign-in, nothing online).
# The anon key is public by design; access is controlled by row-level security in supabase/schema.sql.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
